:"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-30T07:21:49-07:00","id":1488457,"title":"","content":"Arikel (or Ishtar) does look very nice, not at all out of place in this rather special group.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/Xx7pPm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0Gmg8TQ/picture-1.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/Xx7pPm\" target=\"_blank\"> Drawings 1 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/Xx7pPm\" target=\"_blank\"> https://ibb.co/album/Xx7pPm </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Drawings 1 </div> </div> </div><br /> I like that she wears a beautiful simple robe rather than some ornate dress, and that overall Arikel's appearance in this drawing is striking and exceptional.<br /> <br /> I also found some fan illustrations of the Toreador Founder :<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.co.uk/pin/599823244107842039/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.co.uk/pin/599823244107842039/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.co.uk/pin/599823244107842039/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.pinterest.co.uk/pin/599823244107842039/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> But of course neither of them comes close to the proper VtM picture. I consider it a shame that stories in regard to Clan Founders are not more developed throughout VtM. The writers could at least give some hints in regard to what is happening with some of them during the modern nights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 12-22-2022, 06:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-05T03:11:30-07:00","id":1489210,"title":"","content":"Elif Parmak from the coming <i>VtM: Bloodlines 2 </i>is very stylish and beautiful. Really she does look like a cool Tremere Vampiress who possibly has social attributes as primary.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/MD9LJx\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4FtQbGT/Drawing-8.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/MD9LJx\" target=\"_blank\"> Illustrations 1 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://ibb.co/album/MD9LJx\" target=\"_blank\"> https://ibb.co/album/MD9LJx </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Illustrations 1 </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I do hope that <i>Bloodlines 2</i> will be a great game with intricate, complex and varied gameplay. Bloodlines 1 certainly is, but the sequel could be a lot better in so many ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}